  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Sol Serenity, a newly built 4-bedroom, 4-bath retreat offering modern luxury and laid-back coastal living in quiet Inlet Beach. Just 100 steps from the sand and just a few steps from the community pool, this spacious home features four en-suites, two living areas, and breathtaking Gulf views from a large third-floor deck.<br><br>The main living area is open and inviting, with contemporary furnishings, a fireplace, and natural light filling the space. The kitchen includes stainless steel appliances, marble counters, and seating for both casual and formal dining. Upstairs, a second lounge with arcade games and a foosball table opens to the expansive outdoor deck, complete with a grill, dining space, and sweeping Gulf views—ideal for sunset dinners or stargazing.<br><br>Each bedroom is designed for comfort, including three king suites and a bunk room with two twin bunks. Every room features a private bath, flat-screen TV, and stylish décor. Six complimentary beach cruisers make it easy to explore nearby Rosemary and Alys Beach, while seasonal beach chair service adds a touch of convenience.<br><br>Blending privacy, design, and location, Sol Serenity offers the best of 30A living—steps from the beach, minutes from top dining and shops, and surrounded by the peaceful charm of Inlet Beach.<br><br> Also included: Jeep (two days), 4 bikes, significant discounts on golf carts, E-bikes, car rentals, baby gear, paddle boards and more...",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
